{% if output_format == "phases_table" %}
Format (phases_table): a Markdown table — Fase | Horas | Descripción — plus
a totals line. Nothing else.
{% elif output_format == "line_items" %}
Format (line_items): a flat bullet list, one task per line with its hours.
Nothing else.
{% elif output_format == "narrative" %}
Format (narrative): prose only. No tables, no bullet lists for the breakdown.
{% endif %}

{% if detail_level == "summary" %}
Depth (summary): totals only — hours, team, duration, cost. No per-task
breakdown.
{% elif detail_level == "medium" %}
Depth (medium): 4 to 6 breakdown items, plus totals, team, duration, cost.
{% elif detail_level == "detailed" %}
Depth (detailed): full breakdown, totals, team, duration, cost, and
each phase's own assumptions and risks listed separately — not one
global section.
{% endif %}

